                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Look if your hoping for a \"AAA\" Title with all the graphical glory a modern PC can deliver, then this is not for you.  However if you like football and want a playable Football game on PC, then you should give this a try.  It has its quirks but it also has upside and potential.  With NCAA and NFL mods available from the community modders, it just makes the game all that much better.  \n\nSmaller Devs just don't have the resources to push out a Madden equivilant, and you shouldn't expect that.  Take it for what it is, play it and enjoy it.  I will give the AXIS team credit they seem to be responsive to the communtiy and actually make attempts to improve the game. So Kudos to them.",
